# From save slot 1 (Gosu): depart with the right soft key, autopilot (9) to the
# S.T.R.E.A.M. gate, through it to the next station on the map, docking there.
wait 40
midp -5
wait 220
midp -2
wait 30
midp -5
wait 60
midp -5
until station 1500
wait 120
midp -7
wait 60
midp -5
until flight 1500
wait 120
midp 57 4
wait 1200
# the destination, on the map: Navigation, a station to the right, go
midp -5
wait 120
midp -4
wait 60
midp -5
wait 150
# the depth view of the station picked: right to the next one, OK to go
midp -4
wait 80
midp -6
wait 120
midp -5
# the arrival; dock (0) when the station offers it
wait 1300
midp 48 4
wait 100
midp 48 4
wait 100
midp 48 4
wait 1800
